ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_GermanReticle_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>3-Post Dot Sight<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_GermanReticle_Armas_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Custom High-Magnification Scope greatly improves accuracy when focusing in marksmanship mode, while providing an open 3-post reticle with a central dot to provide a clear view.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ExtendedBarrel_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>ACES Extended Barrel<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ExtendedBarrel_Description=The ACES Extended Barrel transforms what is primarily an SMG platform into a pseudo-rifle. The longer rifled barrel allows for higher velocity rounds to be used, increasing damage. The reduced fire rate is also a blessing in disguise, making the accuracy bloom more managable.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ShortBarrel_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>ACES Short Barrel<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ShortBarrel_Description=The default configuration for the ACES, the Short Barrel allows for the system to output more bullets without worry of ruining the weapon barrel. Accuracy however is decreased due to the increased fire rate and lack of rifling.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_AdvancedIronsight_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Advanced Ironsight<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_AdvancedIronsight_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Advanced Iron sight which greatly improves accuracy when focusing in marksmanship mode without increased magnification.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_ArmoredEngine1_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Armored Engine 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_ArmoredEngine1_Description=Engine Modification - ↵Kevlar plates around the engine block slightly increase the amount of damage the vehicle must take before it is set on fire.

