ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Blowtorch_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Blowtorch<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Blowtorch_Description=Activated Modification - ↵This blowtorch will repair any metal objects it hits, especially useful to keep your vehicle in good repair. Not recommended for use as emergency first aid.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Blowtorch_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Blowtorch<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Blowtorch_Joker_Description=Activated Modification - ↵This blowtorch will repair any metal objects it hits, especially useful to keep your vehicle in good repair. Not recommended for use as emergency first aid.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Brick_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Brick<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Brick_Description=Activated Modification - ↵Not exactly the most technologically impressive modification on the market, but a brick on the accelerator will allow the user to jump out of the vehicle while it keeps accelerating towards your intended target, keeping them occupied enough for you to take them down.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Brick_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Brick<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Brick_Joker_Description=Activated Modification - ↵Not exactly the most technologically impressive modification on the market, but a brick on the accelerator will allow the user to jump out of the vehicle while it keeps accelerating towards your intended target, keeping them occupied enough for you to take them down.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_BurstAvalanche_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Burst Avalanche<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_BurstAvalanche_Armas_Description=Barrel Modification- ↵These barrel adjustments allow the weapon to fire an extra round per burst of the weapon. Less powerful loads need to be used to stop the barrel wearing out with the increased throughput.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_BurstKingdom_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Burst Kingdom<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_BurstKingdom_Armas_Description=Barrel Modification- ↵A burst module designed to turn previously fully automatic weapons into burst rifles with superior accuracy.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_CarSurfer_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Car Surfer<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_CarSurfer_Description=Utility Modification -  ↵By utilising years of training in balance and poise, you are able to keep steady on the roofs of moving vehicles.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_CarSurfer_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Car Surfer<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_CarSurfer_Joker_Description=Utility Modification -  ↵By utilising years of training in balance and poise, you are able to keep steady on the roofs of moving vehicles.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ChamberedRound_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Chambered Round<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ChamberedRound_Armas_Description=Receiver Modification- ↵A round left in the chamber speeds up reloading.

