ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_EOL-Concussion_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Concussion 40mm Grenades<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_EOL-Concussion_Description=Adaptations to fire concussion style grenades that arm after a medium duration in the air. These bounce very little and do extreme damage to targets caught in their small blast radius, especially vehicles.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ControlledAim_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Controlled Aim<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ControlledAim_Armas_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵When entering marksmanship mode the weapon switches state, lowering fire rate and heavily increasing accuracy in order to improve the ability to land shots at range.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_CoolingJacket1_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Cooling Jacket 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_CoolingJacket1_Description=Barrel Modification - ↵A Cooling Jacket reduces the heat generated with continuous fire, allowing the weapon to fire slightly closer to its cyclic rate.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_CoolingJacket1_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Cooling Jacket 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
