ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_BananaMag_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Curved Magazine<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_BananaMag_Armas_Description=Magazine Modification- ↵A curved magazine allows you to fit more rounds into the weapon without requiring longer to load or unload. They do however take up more space, reducing the number you can hold in reserve.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_UL3-Damage_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Deadly Fear Special<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_UL3-Damage_Description=Magazine Modification- ↵Frangible rounds deal more damage against fleshy targets close up but are less aerodynamic, losing momentum and thus impact potential at range, along with doing almost no damage against hard targets.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Flag_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Display Banner<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Flag_Description=Activated Modification - ↵This deployable banner projects your personal symbol, projecting your dominance to all-comers.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_DoubleDrum_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Double-Drum Mag<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_DoubleDrum_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Double-drums massively extend the amount of ammunition the weapon can hold in both the magazine and storage, at costs to several other areas.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_UL3-Distance_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Eternal Traveler Special<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_UL3-Distance_Description=Barrel Modification- ↵While quickly overwhelmed, shock absorbers between the barrel and stock provide a small initial increase to accuracy along with heavily reducing the accuracy lost in the initial rounds of a burst.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Explosives1_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Explosives 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Explosives1_Description=Generic Modification - ↵Explosives and shrapnel within the vehicle's frame slightly increase the blast radius when it explodes.

