ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Kevlar2_Description=Health Modification - ↵Subdermal Kevlar Implants moderately decrease the amount of damage you take from incoming fire.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Kevlar2_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Kevlar Implants II<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Kevlar2_Armas_Description=Health Modification - ↵Subdermal Kevlar Implants moderately decrease the amount of damage you take from incoming fire.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Kevlar3_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Kevlar Implants III<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Kevlar3_Description=Health Modification - ↵Subdermal Kevlar Implants heavily decrease the amount of damage you take from incoming fire.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_LightweightFrame_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Lightweight Frame<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_LightweightFrame_Description=Receiver Modification - ↵A light weight weapon frame designed for the heavier end of common firearms to be operated more freely.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_LongRangeRifling_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Long-Range Rifling<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_LongRangeRifling_Description=Barrel Modification - ↵An experimental barrel consisting of a very thin steel wrapped with carbon fiber, resulting in a weapon that can effectively hit targets much further away, with a moderate reduction to fire rate to prevent the layers from splitting.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_EOL-LightFrag_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Low-Yield 40mm Grenades<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_EOL-LightFrag_Description=Adaptations to fire low-yield style grenades that arm after a short duration in the air. These do medium damage over an average blast radius.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull1_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Magazine Pull 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull1_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Rubberized loops on the magazines allow them to be handled easier, slightly improving reload times.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull1_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Magazine Pull 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull1_Joker_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Rubberized loops on the magazines allow them to be handled easier, slightly improving reload times.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull2_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Magazine Pull 2<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull2_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Rubberized loops on the magazines allow them to be handled easier, moderately improving reload times.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull2_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Magazine Pull 2<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull2_Joker_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Rubberized loops on the magazines allow them to be handled easier, moderately improving reload times.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull3_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Magazine Pull 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull3_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Rubberized loops on the magazines allow them to be handled easier, greatly improving reload times.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull3_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Magazine Pull 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull3_Joker_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Rubberized loops on the magazines allow them to be handled easier, greatly improving reload times.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull3_Tutorial_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Magazine Pull 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MagazinePull3_Tutorial_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Rubberized loops on the magazines allow them to be handled easier, greatly improving reload times.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MechanicalChoke_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Mechanical Choke<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MechanicalChoke_Description=Barrel Modification- ↵Complex mechanisms in the barrel allow the weapon to dynamically adjust the Shotgun's choke on the fly. This allows the user to gain a tighter spread by entering marksmanship mode, at the cost of fire rate.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Meteor_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Meteor!<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Meteor_Description=Activated Modification -  ↵When Activated, Meteor will activate several systems in the vehicle. It will accelerate to maximum speed with a small amount of on-board Nitrous Oxide, and impact sensors on the vehicle will trigger a self-destruct when they are triggered by a collision or excessive gunfire.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MicroRockets_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Micro-Rockets<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MicroRockets_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Micro-Rockets are smaller, less powerful projectiles that can be loaded two at a time. They have a smaller blast radius, and are affected by gravity, but fly faster and gain damage as they fly. At 83m each rocket is as effective as an OSMAW.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Norsemen-Hel-Mini_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Minor Hel Special<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Norsemen-Hel-Mini_Description=Barrel Modification- ↵Rounds are cycled through the action  more fluidly when the weapon is fired continuously, resulting in slightly better accuracy as you fire more.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Norsemen-Hoenir-Mini_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Minor Hoenir Special<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Norsemen-Hoenir-Mini_Description=Magazine Modification- ↵Less bullets make the magazine slightly lighter, allowing it to be removed more easily.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Norsemen-Tyr-Mini_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Minor Tyr Special<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Norsemen-Tyr-Mini_Description=Receiver Modification- ↵As more bullets are fired, recoil compensators kick in to reduce recoil and partially stabalise the weapon. A two-point sling also reduces equip time.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_MobileCover_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Mobile Cover<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_MobileCover_Description=Activated Modification - ↵Spawns a piece of Mobile Cover, painted with your personal Graffiti.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RadarTower_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Mobile Radar Tower<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RadarTower_Description=Trunk Modification - ↵A Mobile Radar Tower in the trunk of your vehicle can detect nearby enemies and show them on your radar even when you are not inside the vehicle. Any enemies detected in this way can see your vehicle on their radar.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RadarTower_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Mobile Radar Tower<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RadarTower_Joker_Description=Trunk Modification - ↵A Mobile Radar Tower in the trunk of your vehicle can detect nearby enemies and show them on your radar even when you are not inside the vehicle. Any enemies detected in this way can see your vehicle on their radar.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_MobileSpawnPoint_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Mobile Spawn Point<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_MobileSpawnPoint_Description=Trunk Modification -  ↵Turns your vehicle into a Mobile Spawn Point. You can spawn from any vehicle with Mobile Spawn Point once every 2 minutes.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_MobileSupplyUnit_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Mobile Supply Unit<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_MobileSupplyUnit_Description=Trunk Modification -  ↵Turns your vehicle into an ammo distributor, allowing you and your group to restock your weapons.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MobilitySling_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Mobility Sling<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MobilitySling_Description=Receiver Modification - ↵ ↵A Joker manufactured sling designed to act as a stability aid while moving. This allows the user to walk or run faster while in marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MobilitySling_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Mobility Sling<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MobilitySling_Joker_Description=Receiver Modification - ↵ ↵A Joker manufactured sling designed to act as a stability aid while moving. This allows the user to walk or run faster while in marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Muffler_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Muffler<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Muffler_Description=Engine Modification - ↵A muffled exhaust hides your vehicle from enemy radar as long as you are not accelerating. Additional tweaks reduce engine braking, allowing you to coast for long distances.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Muffler_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Muffler<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Muffler_Joker_Description=Engine Modification - ↵A muffled exhaust hides your vehicle from enemy radar as long as you are not accelerating. Additional tweaks reduce engine braking, allowing you to coast for long distances.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MuzzleBrake_Horizontal_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Muzzle Brake (Horizontal)<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MuzzleBrake_Horizontal_Description=Barrel Modification - ↵This recoil compensator takes gases produced by the weapon and directs them to the sides, reducing horizontal recoil at the expense of vertical.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MuzzleBrake_Vertical_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Muzzle Brake (Vertical)<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_MuzzleBrake_Vertical_Description=Barrel Modification - ↵This recoil compensator takes gases produced by the weapon and directs them upwards, reducing vertical recoil at the expense of horizontal.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro1_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Nitro Booster 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro1_Description=Activated Modification - ↵NOS injectors allow the user to trigger a period of slightly improved engine performance.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro1_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Nitro Booster 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro1_Joker_Description=Activated Modification - ↵NOS injectors allow the user to trigger a period of slightly improved engine performance.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro2_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Nitro Booster 2<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro2_Description=Activated Modification - ↵NOS injectors allow the user to trigger a period of moderately improved engine performance.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro2_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Nitro Booster 2<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro2_Joker_Description=Activated Modification - ↵NOS injectors allow the user to trigger a period of moderately improved engine performance.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro3_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Nitro Booster 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro3_Description=Activated Modification - ↵NOS injectors allow the user to trigger a period of greatly improved engine performance.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro3_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Nitro Booster 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Nitro3_Joker_Description=Activated Modification - ↵NOS injectors allow the user to trigger a period of greatly improved engine performance.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_EOL-Percussion_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Percussion 40mm Grenade<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_EOL-Percussion_Description=Adaptations to fire percussion style grenades that arm after a very short duration in the air. These do medium damage over an short blast radius.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Piercing_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Piercing<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Piercing_Description=Receiver Modification - ↵Adjustments to the firing mechanism of the weapon allow the bullets to pierce most objects they hit (not including vehicles and walls). The act of piercing an object however heavily reduces the hard damage, as well as reducing the damage done to subsequent objects hit.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Piercing_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Piercing<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Piercing_Armas_Description=Receiver Modification - ↵Adjustments to the firing mechanism of the weapon allow the bullets to pierce most objects they hit (not including vehicles and walls). The act of piercing an object however heavily reduces the hard damage, as well as reducing the damage done to subsequent objects hit.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Piercing_NCR_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Piercing Precision<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Piercing_NCR_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵An improved sight coupled with piercing rounds to ensure pin-point accuracy as well as immense stopping power.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Piercing_NCR_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Piercing Precision<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Piercing_NCR_Armas_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵An improved sight coupled with piercing rounds to ensure pin-point accuracy as well as immense stopping power.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_PistolChoke_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Pistol Choke<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_PistolChoke_Description=Barrel Modification- ↵A custom choked barrel for the Showstopper, this tightens the spread of the weapon and increases the effective range. Fire rate has been reduced in order to reduce wear to the barrel.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_C9S_Sight_Armas_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Prototype Switch<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_C9S_Sight_Armas_Description=Barrel Modification - ↵A custom fitted silencer combined with a prototype weapon switch allowing bullets  ↵to be fired at a much higher velocity for increased damage.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_RadarJammer_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Radar Jammer<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_RadarJammer_Description=Activated Modification - ↵A mobile jamming device allows you to jam any enemy targets in the area, transmitting your Personal Graffiti directly over their radar. The power for this however highlights you on the radar to any players not jammed.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_RadarJammer_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Radar Jammer<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_RadarJammer_Joker_Description=Activated Modification - ↵A mobile jamming device allows you to jam any enemy targets in the area, transmitting your Personal Graffiti directly over their radar. The power for this however highlights you on the radar to any players not jammed.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate1_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Ramming Plate 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate1_Description=Chassis Modification - ↵Tough Iron Plates mounted at the front of the vehicle's engine slightly increases the force transmitted when ramming enemy vehicles or objects.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate1_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Ramming Plate 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate1_Joker_Description=Chassis Modification - ↵Tough Iron Plates mounted at the front of the vehicle's engine slightly increases the force transmitted when ramming enemy vehicles or objects.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate2_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Ramming Plate 2<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate2_Description=Chassis Modification - ↵Tough Iron Plates mounted at the front of the vehicle's engine noticeably increases the force transmitted when ramming enemy vehicles or objects.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate2_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Ramming Plate 2<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate2_Joker_Description=Chassis Modification - ↵Tough Iron Plates mounted at the front of the vehicle's engine noticeably increases the force transmitted when ramming enemy vehicles or objects.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate3_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Ramming Plate 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate3_Description=Chassis Modification - ↵Tough Iron Plates mounted at the front of the vehicle's engine greatly increases the force transmitted when ramming enemy vehicles or objects.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate3_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Ramming Plate 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_RammingPlate3_Joker_Description=Chassis Modification - ↵Tough Iron Plates mounted at the front of the vehicle's engine greatly increases the force transmitted when ramming enemy vehicles or objects.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight1_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Reflex Sight 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight1_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Reflex sights allow for faster target aquisition at close ranges without obscuring the user's field of view.  This helps slightly improve accuracy outside marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight1_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Reflex Sight 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight1_Joker_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Reflex sights allow for faster target aquisition at close ranges without obscuring the user's field of view.  This helps slightly improve accuracy outside marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight2_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Reflex Sight 2<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight2_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Reflex sights allow for faster target aquisition at close ranges without obscuring the user's field of view.  This helps moderately improve accuracy outside marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight2_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Reflex Sight 2<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight2_Joker_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Reflex sights allow for faster target aquisition at close ranges without obscuring the user's field of view.  This helps moderately improve accuracy outside marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight3_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Reflex Sight 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight3_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Reflex sights allow for faster target aquisition at close ranges without obscuring the user's field of view.  This helps heavily improve accuracy outside marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight3_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Reflex Sight 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight3_Joker_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Reflex sights allow for faster target aquisition at close ranges without obscuring the user's field of view.  This helps heavily improve accuracy outside marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight3_Tutorial_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Reflex Sight 3<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ReflexSight3_Tutorial_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵Reflex sights allow for faster target aquisition at close ranges without obscuring the user's field of view.  This helps heavily improve accuracy outside marksmanship mode.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_RemoteDetonator_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Remote Detonator<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_RemoteDetonator_Description=Activated Modification - ↵A custom detonator paired with small explosives planted within your personal vehicle allows you to explode it from a distance.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_RemoteDetonator_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Remote Detonator<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_RemoteDetonator_Joker_Description=Activated Modification - ↵A custom detonator paired with small explosives planted around your personal vehicle allows you to explode it from a distance.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_SelectFire_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Select Fire<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_SelectFire_Description=Receiver Modification- ↵The weapon will now switch to Burst-Fire Mode when entering Marksmanship.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ShotgunSlug_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Shotgun Slug<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_ShotgunSlug_Description=Magazine Modification - ↵Modifies the gun to be able to fire slug ammo. Slug ammo being slightly larger than other shotgun shells also reduces the maximum magazine by one.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Silencer_Reaper_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.596078 G=0.082353 B=0.768628>Silencer - Reaper<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Silencer_Reaper_Description=Receiver Modification- ↵A Suppressor designed by none other than Devil Dog himself. Optimized to the utmost to help the user stay unnoticed around San Paro.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_UL3-FireRate_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Speed Demon Special<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_UL3-FireRate_Description=Barrel Modification- ↵Despite the extremely efficient nature of this Cooling Jacket, generated heat is still enough with the increased fire rate to expand the barrel and cause the weapon to lose accuracy when fired continually.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Spotter_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Spotter<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Spotter_Description=Activated Modification - ↵Cross-Team Heads-up modifications allow you to target and track enemies you spot through walls and other obstacles, relaying this information to your teammates for a short duration.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Spotter_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Spotter<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Spotter_Joker_Description=Activated Modification - ↵Cross-Team Heads-up modifications allow you to target and track enemies you spot through walls and other obstacles, relaying this information to your teammates for a short duration.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Cantedsight_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.400000 B=0.000000>Steady Sight<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Cantedsight_Description=Upper Rail Modification - ↵An advanced sight enabling a clear sight picture with integrated features to allow for steadier target acquisition.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_SteelPlating1_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Steel Plating 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_SteelPlating1_Description=Chassis Modification - ↵Steel Plates in the vehicle's chassis slightly reduces the damage caused by weapons fire.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_SteelPlating1_Joker_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.270588 G=1.000000 B=0.086275>Steel Plating 1<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_SteelPlating1_Joker_Description=Chassis Modification - ↵Steel Plates in the vehicle's chassis slightly reduces the damage caused by weapons fire.

