ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_SteeringAngle_Description=Tuning Modification - ↵A high-angle performance setup featuring enhanced steering knuckles and rack geometry to allow for tighter steering angles.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Suspension_Tuning_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>Suspension Tuning<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Vehicle_Suspension_Tuning_Description=Tuning Modification - ↵Extra light shock absorbers to soften a vehicle’s suspension and allow for a smoother feel when operating the vehicle.

