ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Norsemen-Tyr_Description=Receiver Modification- ↵As more bullets are fired, recoil compensators kick in to reduce recoil and stabalise the weapon. A three-point sling also reduces equip time.

ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Valzipram_DisplayName=<Color:R=0.035294 G=0.470588 B=1.000000>Valzipram Tablets<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Character_Valzipram_Description=Utility Modification - ↵Over the counter medication to relax your muscles during times of great stress. This flexibility allows you to survive hits from vehicles at greater speeds.

