ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Raptor_Silencer_DisplayName=<Color:R=1.000000 G=0.000000 B=0.000000>XTD-7s Silencer<Color:R=1 G=1 B=1>
ModifierItemTypes_FnMod_Weapon_Raptor_Silencer_Description=Barrel Modification- ↵The XTD-7s Silencer combines high-tech materials with the pinnacle of baffle design in order to create a weapon that's so whisper quiet, it won't show up initially on even the most sophisticated listening devices.

